WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:07.200
Meet the 3D Shed Builder. Enterprise-grade quoting software for the people who build sheds and garages.

2
00:00:08.606 --> 00:00:13.406
Your customers design the real building, on your website, in 3D.

3
00:00:13.606 --> 00:00:16.406
Every style. Every size you sell.

4
00:00:16.846 --> 00:00:23.466
Pick the colors you stock. Add doors and windows and drag them into place, every spot checked against the roof.

5
00:00:24.881 --> 00:00:30.081
Open the doors and look inside. Framing, wiring, insulation, drywall.

6
00:00:30.181 --> 00:00:32.411
If you can build it, we can render it.

7
00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:40.309
Every click updates the price, line by line. When they send the quote, it lands with you as a lead.

8
00:00:41.009 --> 00:00:46.209
Every build has its own link. Open it anywhere, and the exact building comes back.

9
00:00:46.227 --> 00:00:51.077
It runs on your numbers. Your prices, your materials, your fees.

10
00:00:51.231 --> 00:00:53.331
Your brand. Your leads.

11
00:00:53.531 --> 00:00:59.831
The 3D Shed Builder, from Tevis Engineering. Try the live demo at tevisengineering.com.
